    "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;The Latina fighting Satina in Hell!&quot;</i><br><br>A Third-Person shooter in the Survival Horror genre with light Platforming! <br><br>Save your family from the female Satan &quot;Satina&quot; who has crashed your family's plane and stolen your father! <br>Use the weapons littered throughout Hell to blast your way through the demons in your way! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567760/extras/74127ccdec65c67660a6714b2b21892d.poster.avif?t=1694739982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567760/extras/74127ccdec65c67660a6714b2b21892d.webm?t=1694739982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567760/extras/74127ccdec65c67660a6714b2b21892d.mp4?t=1694739982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Lucia and the Possessed world, <br>- Find the 10+ characters that will give you <br>- shotguns, rifles, and explosives needed to progress. <br>- Use your newfound weapons to eliminate enemies <br>- through 10 Levels in a hellish landscape! <br>- Finally, beat the boss, Satina, with all your skills and platforming tactics you've gained on your journey. <br><br>A game with thrilling visuals, challenging platforming, fun characters and enemies to explore!<br><br>(for fans of): <br><br>(2022) Metal: Hellsinger <br>(2016) Doom<br>(2009) Br\u00fctal Legend<br>(2005) The Warriors<br>(2001) Conker's Bad Fur Day<br>(1999) Silent Hill<br>(1998) Half-Life<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567760/extras/60d4aa8756e2240c51721a32ea6ef3b0.poster.avif?t=1694739982\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_